              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "(d) Gases collected in the test tubes Fig. 8.8: Passing electricity through water"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.397,
            0.08,
            0.655,
            0.099
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Wait for a few minutes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.396,
            0.101,
            0.882,
            0.139
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you observe the formation of any gas bubbles at both the terminals inside the test tubes?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.397,
            0.141,
            0.752,
            0.159
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Let it continue for 10–15 minutes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.397,
            0.161,
            0.883,
            0.199
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Observe the volume of gas collected in each test tube (Fig. 8.8d)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.397,
            0.2,
            0.882,
            0.237
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Is the volume of the gas collected the same in both the test tubes?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.398,
            0.24,
            0.851,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Remove these test tubes one-by-one carefully."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.399,
            0.261,
            0.883,
            0.316
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Test these gases one-by-one by bringing a burning candle close to the mouth of the test tubes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.399,
            0.318,
            0.702,
            0.339
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What happens in each case?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.399,
            0.34,
            0.803,
            0.36
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Which gas is present in each test tube?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.531,
            0.398,
            0.748,
            0.435
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Can these collected g"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "ases be water vapour",
              "styles": [
                "underline"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.774,
            0.329,
            0.882,
            0.481
          ],
          "content": [
